IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `snap-core`

-- LAYER 1 (the law, objectively): section 2036 of the Food and Nutrition Act of 2008 (7 U.S.C. 2036), "Availability of
-- commodities for emergency food assistance program", lines 3111-3140 of usc07-ch51.txt (snap6's third range).
-- SOURCE: a plain-text rendering made by a converter script from the OLRC's USLM XML. It is not the official text, and
-- nothing here is "verified against the official text".
-- READING A RESULT: a MAYBE BOOLEAN or MAYBE NUMBER answers JUST FALSE only where the text says no in its own words, JUST TRUE
-- where it says yes, and NOTHING everywhere else ("not covered"). Every branch says which kind it is.
-- MONEY is a NUMBER of dollars. A PERCENTAGE input is a figure in percent: 10 means ten percent, so "adjusted by the
-- percentage" multiplies by (1 PLUS the percentage DIVIDED BY 100) (fork FR-36-2).
-- This section is addressed to the Secretary and to the States that distribute the commodities; no household is mentioned.
-- The thrifty food plan percentages are published figures that s 2012(u)(3) gives, so they are conditional inputs (SEAMS.md).

-- HELPERS (not a rule of the Act): three-valued AND / OR over MAYBE BOOLEAN, so that a NOTHING input is passed through
-- unless another limb decides the answer without it (PLAN.md section 4).
GIVEN xs IS A LIST OF MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2036 every one of these holds` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF elem (JUST FALSE) xs THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): one limb is the text's no, so the whole is, wherever that no came from
        IF elem NOTHING xs THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): a limb is not covered and no other limb says no
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: every limb holds

GIVEN xs IS A LIST OF MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2036 at least one of these holds` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF elem (JUST TRUE) xs THEN JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: one limb holds
        IF elem NOTHING xs THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): a limb is not covered and no other limb holds
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): every limb is the text's no

§ `s 2036 -- Availability of commodities for emergency food assistance program`

-- (a)(1): the acts the Secretary is told to do.
DECLARE `s 2036 act` IS ONE OF
    `s 2036 purchase commodities and distribute them to States`
    `s 2036 make the funds available for 2 fiscal years`
    `s 2036 allow States to carry over unexpended balances to the next fiscal year`

-- (b): the three things purchases are based on.
DECLARE `s 2036 basis of purchases` HAS
    `agricultural market conditions`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `preferences and needs of States and distributing agencies` IS A BOOLEAN
    `preferences of recipients`                            IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `(a) Purchase of commodities`

-- (a)(1) "From amounts made available to carry out this chapter, for each of the fiscal years 2014 through 2023, the Secretary
-- shall purchase a dollar amount described in paragraph (2) of a variety of nutritious and useful commodities of the types that
-- the Secretary has the authority to acquire through the Commodity Credit Corporation or under section 612c of this title and
-- distribute the commodities to States for distribution in accordance with section 7515 of this title."
-- src:3113 | (1) In general
-- src:3114 | From amounts made available to carry out this chapter, for each of the fiscal years 2014 through 2023, the Secretary shall purchase a dollar amount described in paragraph (2) of a variety of nutritious and useful commodities of the types that the Secretary has the authority to acquire through the Commodity Credit Corporation or under section 612c of this title and distribute the commodities to States for distribution in accordance with section 7515 of this title.
@ref s 2036(a)(1) In general (src:3113-3114)
GIVEN `fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2036(a)(1) the Secretary shall purchase commodities in the fiscal year` MEANS
    IF `fiscal year` AT LEAST 2014 AND `fiscal year` AT MOST 2023
    THEN JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: "for each of the fiscal years 2014 through 2023, the Secretary shall purchase"
    ELSE NOTHING     -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): (a)(1) speaks only of fiscal years 2014 through 2023 (fork FR-36-1)

-- src:3113 | (1) In general
-- src:3114 | From amounts made available to carry out this chapter, for each of the fiscal years 2014 through 2023, the Secretary shall purchase a dollar amount described in paragraph (2) of a variety of nutritious and useful commodities of the types that the Secretary has the authority to acquire through the Commodity Credit Corporation or under section 612c of this title and distribute the commodities to States for distribution in accordance with section 7515 of this title.
@ref s 2036(a)(1) the kind of commodity (src:3113-3114)
GIVEN `the commodity is nutritious and useful` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Secretary has the authority to acquire commodities of its type through the Commodity Credit Corporation or under section 612c` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2036(a)(1) the commodity is one the Secretary shall purchase` MEANS
    IF `the commodity is nutritious and useful` AND `the Secretary has the authority to acquire commodities of its type through the Commodity Credit Corporation or under section 612c`
    THEN JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: "a variety of nutritious and useful commodities of the types that the Secretary has the authority to acquire"
    ELSE NOTHING     -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty is to buy commodities of those types

-- src:3113 | (1) In general
-- src:3114 | From amounts made available to carry out this chapter, for each of the fiscal years 2014 through 2023, the Secretary shall purchase a dollar amount described in paragraph (2) of a variety of nutritious and useful commodities of the types that the Secretary has the authority to acquire through the Commodity Credit Corporation or under section 612c of this title and distribute the commodities to States for distribution in accordance with section 7515 of this title.
@ref s 2036(a)(1) the Secretary's duty (src:3113-3114)
`s 2036(a)(1) the Secretary's duty to purchase commodities and distribute them to States` MEANS
    PARTY `the Secretary`
    MUST `s 2036 purchase commodities and distribute them to States`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the Secretary` BECAUSE "the Secretary did not purchase the commodities and distribute them to States"

-- (a)(2) "The Secretary shall use to carry out paragraph (1) (A) for fiscal year 2008, $190,000,000; (B) for fiscal year 2009,
-- $250,000,000; (C) for each of fiscal years 2010 through 2023, the dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (B)
-- adjusted by the percentage by which the thrifty food plan has been adjusted under section 2012(u)(3) of this title between
-- June 30, 2008, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year; (D) for each of fiscal years 2015 through 2023, the sum
-- obtained by adding the total dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (C) and (i) ... (ix); and (E) for fiscal
-- year 2024 and each subsequent fiscal year, the total dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (D)(ix) adjusted by
-- the percentage by which the thrifty food plan has been adjusted under section 2012(u)(3) of this title to reflect changes
-- between June 30, 2023, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year."

-- src:3117 | (A) for fiscal year 2008, $190,000,000;
@ref s 2036(a)(2)(A) fiscal year 2008 (src:3117)
`s 2036(a)(2)(A) the amount for fiscal year 2008, in dollars` MEANS 190000000

-- src:3118 | (B) for fiscal year 2009, $250,000,000;
@ref s 2036(a)(2)(B) fiscal year 2009 (src:3118)
`s 2036(a)(2)(B) the amount for fiscal year 2009, in dollars` MEANS 250000000

-- (C): the amount in (B), adjusted by the percentage. The percentage is the one s 2012(u)(3) gives for the window June 30,
-- 2008 to June 30 of the fiscal year before.
-- src:3119 | (C) for each of fiscal years 2010 through 2023, the dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (B) adjusted by the percentage by which the thrifty food plan has been adjusted under section 2012(u)(3) of this title between June 30, 2008, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year;
@ref s 2036(a)(2)(C) fiscal years 2010 through 2023 (src:3119)
GIVEN `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2008, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 2036(a)(2)(C) the amount for a fiscal year from 2010 through 2023, in dollars` MEANS
    `s 2036(a)(2)(B) the amount for fiscal year 2009, in dollars` TIMES (1 PLUS `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2008, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year` DIVIDED BY 100)

-- (D)(i) to (ix): the sums added to (C)'s amount.
-- src:3121 | (i) for fiscal year 2015, $50,000,000;
-- src:3122 | (ii) for fiscal year 2016, $40,000,000;
-- src:3123 | (iii) for fiscal year 2017, $20,000,000;
-- src:3124 | (iv) for fiscal year 2018, $15,000,000;
-- src:3125 | (v) for fiscal year 2019, $23,000,000;
-- src:3126 | (vi) for fiscal year 2020, $35,000,000;
-- src:3127 | (vii) for fiscal year 2021, $35,000,000;
-- src:3128 | (viii) for fiscal year 2022, $35,000,000; and
-- src:3129 | (ix) for fiscal year 2023, $35,000,000; and
@ref s 2036(a)(2)(D)(i) to (ix) the sums added (src:3121-3129)
GIVEN `fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2015 THEN JUST 50000000   -- (i) "for fiscal year 2015, $50,000,000"
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2016 THEN JUST 40000000   -- (ii) "for fiscal year 2016, $40,000,000"
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2017 THEN JUST 20000000   -- (iii) "for fiscal year 2017, $20,000,000"
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2018 THEN JUST 15000000   -- (iv) "for fiscal year 2018, $15,000,000"
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2019 THEN JUST 23000000   -- (v) "for fiscal year 2019, $23,000,000"
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2020 THEN JUST 35000000   -- (vi) "for fiscal year 2020, $35,000,000"
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2021 THEN JUST 35000000   -- (vii) "for fiscal year 2021, $35,000,000"
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2022 THEN JUST 35000000   -- (viii) "for fiscal year 2022, $35,000,000"
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2023 THEN JUST 35000000   -- (ix) "for fiscal year 2023, $35,000,000"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): (D) names fiscal years 2015 through 2023

-- (D): for fiscal years 2015 through 2023, the (C) amount plus the sum added.
-- src:3120 | (D) for each of fiscal years 2015 through 2023, the sum obtained by adding the total dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (C) and—
@ref s 2036(a)(2)(D) fiscal years 2015 through 2023 (src:3120)
GIVEN `fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
      `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2008, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2036(a)(2)(D) the amount for a fiscal year from 2015 through 2023, in dollars` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` `fiscal year`
    WHEN JUST added THEN JUST (`s 2036(a)(2)(C) the amount for a fiscal year from 2010 through 2023, in dollars` `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2008, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year` PLUS added)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): (D) names fiscal years 2015 through 2023

-- (E): fiscal year 2024 and after: (D)(ix)'s total, adjusted by the percentage for June 30, 2023 to June 30 of the fiscal year
-- before. (D)(ix)'s total is the fiscal year 2023 (C) amount plus $35,000,000, and the (C) amount for 2023 needs the 2008-to-2022
-- percentage.
-- src:3130 | (E) for fiscal year 2024 and each subsequent fiscal year, the total dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (D)(ix) adjusted by the percentage by which the thrifty food plan has been adjusted under section 2012(u)(3) of this title to reflect changes between June 30, 2023, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year.
@ref s 2036(a)(2)(E) fiscal year 2024 and each subsequent fiscal year (src:3130)
GIVEN `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2008, and June 30, 2022` IS A NUMBER
      `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2023, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 2036(a)(2)(E) the amount for fiscal year 2024 and each subsequent fiscal year, in dollars` MEANS
    (`s 2036(a)(2)(C) the amount for a fiscal year from 2010 through 2023, in dollars` `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2008, and June 30, 2022` PLUS 35000000)
    TIMES (1 PLUS `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2023, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year` DIVIDED BY 100)

-- (a)(2) as a whole: the amount the Secretary shall use for a fiscal year, by the subparagraph that names it.
-- src:3115 | (2) Amounts
-- src:3116 | The Secretary shall use to carry out paragraph (1)—
-- src:3117 | (A) for fiscal year 2008, $190,000,000;
-- src:3118 | (B) for fiscal year 2009, $250,000,000;
-- src:3119 | (C) for each of fiscal years 2010 through 2023, the dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (B) adjusted by the percentage by which the thrifty food plan has been adjusted under section 2012(u)(3) of this title between June 30, 2008, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year;
-- src:3120 | (D) for each of fiscal years 2015 through 2023, the sum obtained by adding the total dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (C) and—
-- src:3121 | (i) for fiscal year 2015, $50,000,000;
-- src:3122 | (ii) for fiscal year 2016, $40,000,000;
-- src:3123 | (iii) for fiscal year 2017, $20,000,000;
-- src:3124 | (iv) for fiscal year 2018, $15,000,000;
-- src:3125 | (v) for fiscal year 2019, $23,000,000;
-- src:3126 | (vi) for fiscal year 2020, $35,000,000;
-- src:3127 | (vii) for fiscal year 2021, $35,000,000;
-- src:3128 | (viii) for fiscal year 2022, $35,000,000; and
-- src:3129 | (ix) for fiscal year 2023, $35,000,000; and
-- src:3130 | (E) for fiscal year 2024 and each subsequent fiscal year, the total dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (D)(ix) adjusted by the percentage by which the thrifty food plan has been adjusted under section 2012(u)(3) of this title to reflect changes between June 30, 2023, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year.
@ref s 2036(a)(2) Amounts (src:3115-3130)
GIVEN `fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
      `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2008, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
      `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2008, and June 30, 2022` IS A NUMBER
      `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2023, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2036(a)(2) the amount the Secretary shall use for the fiscal year, in dollars` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2008 THEN JUST `s 2036(a)(2)(A) the amount for fiscal year 2008, in dollars`
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2009 THEN JUST `s 2036(a)(2)(B) the amount for fiscal year 2009, in dollars`
        IF `fiscal year` AT LEAST 2010 AND `fiscal year` AT MOST 2014
           THEN JUST (`s 2036(a)(2)(C) the amount for a fiscal year from 2010 through 2023, in dollars` `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2008, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year`)
        IF `fiscal year` AT LEAST 2015 AND `fiscal year` AT MOST 2023
           THEN `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the amount for a fiscal year from 2015 through 2023, in dollars` `fiscal year` `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2008, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year`
        IF `fiscal year` AT LEAST 2024
           THEN JUST (`s 2036(a)(2)(E) the amount for fiscal year 2024 and each subsequent fiscal year, in dollars` `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2008, and June 30, 2022` `s 2012(u)(3) the percentage by which the thrifty food plan was adjusted between June 30, 2023, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year`)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): no subparagraph names a fiscal year before 2008

-- (a)(3)(A) "the Secretary shall make the funds available for 2 fiscal years": the fiscal year of the funds and the next.
-- src:3131 | (3) Funds availability
-- src:3132 | For purposes of the funds described in this subsection, the Secretary shall—
-- src:3133 | (A) make the funds available for 2 fiscal years; and
@ref s 2036(a)(3)(A) Funds availability for 2 fiscal years (src:3131-3133)
GIVEN `the fiscal year of the funds` IS A NUMBER
      `the fiscal year in question` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2036(a)(3)(A) the funds are available in the fiscal year` MEANS
    IF `the fiscal year in question` EQUALS `the fiscal year of the funds` OR `the fiscal year in question` EQUALS `the fiscal year of the funds` PLUS 1
    THEN JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: "make the funds available for 2 fiscal years" (the year of the funds and the next: fork FR-36-4)
    ELSE NOTHING     -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the text makes them available for 2 fiscal years and says nothing of the others

-- src:3131 | (3) Funds availability
-- src:3132 | For purposes of the funds described in this subsection, the Secretary shall—
-- src:3133 | (A) make the funds available for 2 fiscal years; and
@ref s 2036(a)(3)(A) the Secretary's duty (src:3131-3133)
`s 2036(a)(3)(A) the Secretary's duty to make the funds available for 2 fiscal years` MEANS
    PARTY `the Secretary`
    MUST `s 2036 make the funds available for 2 fiscal years`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the Secretary` BECAUSE "the Secretary did not make the funds available for 2 fiscal years"

-- (a)(3)(B) "allow States to carry over unexpended balances to the next fiscal year pursuant to such terms and conditions as are
-- determined by the Secretary."
-- src:3131 | (3) Funds availability
-- src:3132 | For purposes of the funds described in this subsection, the Secretary shall—
-- src:3133 | (A) make the funds available for 2 fiscal years; and
-- src:3134 | (B) allow States to carry over unexpended balances to the next fiscal year pursuant to such terms and conditions as are determined by the Secretary.
@ref s 2036(a)(3)(B) Carry over (src:3131-3134)
GIVEN `the State's balance is unexpended` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the State meets the terms and conditions the Secretary determined` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2036(a)(3)(B) the State may carry the balance over to the next fiscal year` MEANS
    IF `the State's balance is unexpended` AND `the State meets the terms and conditions the Secretary determined` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: "allow States to carry over unexpended balances to the next fiscal year"
    ELSE NOTHING     -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the terms and conditions are the Secretary's, not stated here

-- src:3134 | (B) allow States to carry over unexpended balances to the next fiscal year pursuant to such terms and conditions as are determined by the Secretary.
@ref s 2036(a)(3)(B) the Secretary's duty (src:3134)
`s 2036(a)(3)(B) the Secretary's duty to allow States to carry over unexpended balances` MEANS
    PARTY `the Secretary`
    MUST `s 2036 allow States to carry over unexpended balances to the next fiscal year`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the Secretary` BECAUSE "the Secretary did not allow States to carry over unexpended balances to the next fiscal year"

§§ `(b) Basis for commodity purchases`

-- (b) "In purchasing commodities under subsection (a), the Secretary shall, to the extent practicable and appropriate, make
-- purchases based on (1) agricultural market conditions; (2) preferences and needs of States and distributing agencies; and (3)
-- preferences of recipients." "Practicable and appropriate" is the Secretary's judgment, taken as a plain input.
-- src:3135 | (b) Basis for commodity purchases
-- src:3136 | In purchasing commodities under subsection (a), the Secretary shall, to the extent practicable and appropriate, make purchases based on—
-- src:3137 | (1) agricultural market conditions;
-- src:3138 | (2) preferences and needs of States and distributing agencies; and
-- src:3139 | (3) preferences of recipients.
@ref s 2036(b) Basis for commodity purchases (src:3135-3139)
GIVEN `it is practicable and appropriate` IS A BOOLEAN
      basis IS A `s 2036 basis of purchases`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2036(b) the purchases are based as the Secretary shall base them` MEANS
    IF `it is practicable and appropriate` AND basis's `agricultural market conditions` AND basis's `preferences and needs of States and distributing agencies` AND basis's `preferences of recipients`
    THEN JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: "shall, to the extent practicable and appropriate, make purchases based on (1) ...; (2) ...; and (3)"
    ELSE NOTHING     -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "to the extent practicable and appropriate"; the text does not say what follows when a basis is left out
